# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 5 (`@Switch` follows the event its dynamic holds) and Type System ch. 4 (a function lifted over a dynamic is applied at each of its values); the label's place number and the tick it moves in are guesses a real run may correct.
test counted_then_told

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="count")
    1: Ui.Button(label="tell")
    3: Ui.Label(text="said nothing")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click

tick 2
  in:
    1: click
  changed:
    3: Ui.Label(text="said now 1")
